bottomparticipants

actor Admin
boundary "Genre Management UI" as UI
boundary Router
control GenreController
control GenreService
entity ":GenreModel" as GenreModel
database MongoDB

Admin -> UI: 1. Click "Hide/Unhide" button
activate Admin
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. PATCH /genre/{id}/toggle-status
activate Router

Router -> Router: 3. Check token / role
activate Router
space
deactivate Router

alt Token invalid
    Router --> UI: 3.1.1. 401 Unauthorized
    UI --> Admin: 3.1.2. Show error message
else Role invalid
    Router --> UI: 3.2.1. 403 Forbidden
    UI --> Admin: 3.2.2. Show error message
end
Router -> GenreController: 4. toggleStatus(id)
activate GenreController

GenreController -> GenreService: 5. toggleStatus(id)
activate GenreService

GenreService -> GenreService: 6. Validate
activate GenreService
space
deactivate GenreService

opt Invalid ObjectId
    GenreService --> GenreController: 6.1. Throw BadRequest
    GenreController --> Router: 6.2. HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 6.3. Invalid ID error
    UI --> Admin: 6.4. Show error message
end
GenreService -> GenreModel: 7. findById(id)
activate GenreModel
GenreModel -> MongoDB: 8. query document
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> GenreModel: 9. Genre document
deactivate MongoDB
GenreModel --> GenreService: 10. Genre
deactivate GenreModel

GenreService -> GenreService: 11. Check genres
activate GenreService
space
deactivate GenreService

opt Not found
    GenreService --> GenreController: 11.1. Throw NotFound
    GenreController --> Router: 11.2. HTTP 404 response
    Router --> UI: 11.3. Not found error
    UI --> Admin: 11.4. Show error message
end


GenreService -> GenreService: 12. Toggle status
activate GenreService
space
deactivate GenreService
GenreService -> GenreModel: 13. save()
activate GenreModel
GenreModel -> MongoDB: 14. update document
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> GenreModel: 15. Updated document
deactivate MongoDB
GenreModel --> GenreService: 16. Updated genre
deactivate GenreModel

GenreService --> GenreController: 17. Updated genre
deactivate GenreService
GenreController --> Router: 18. HTTP 200 response
deactivate GenreController
Router --> UI: 19. Return updated genre
deactivate Router
UI --> Admin: 20. Toggle status success
deactivate UI
deactivate Admin